[00:09.34]It never goes how you wanted
[00:14.10]And I wanted you bad
[00:18.08]So in sync when we started
[00:22.69]Now I don't understand
[00:25.49]How we went from wrapped around each other through the summer under covers
[00:30.17]Then spent January sleeping back to back
[00:35.29]God knows I still want you like the moment that I met you
[00:39.08]But it takes the both of us to make it last
[00:43.50]When you hold me at a distance
[00:45.75]I can tell that something's missing
[00:47.94]Like I blinked and your heart disappeared
[00:52.21]Cause even when you're right beside me
[00:54.44]With your arms wrapped around me
[00:56.69]I still wish I still wish you were here
[01:00.86]Ahhhhh
